From: Aspartame GTK4 migration
Subject: [PATCH] radio palette: name each sharing option

GTK4 radio palette options are icon-only ToolButtons.  Their human labels
were stored only as palette metadata, so AT-SPI exposed anonymous buttons and
the sharing choices could not be activated reliably from keyboard or
automation.  Preserve the compact Sugar palette while giving each option its
stable accessible label.

--- a/src/sugar4/graphics/radiopalette.py
+++ b/src/sugar4/graphics/radiopalette.py
@@ -171,1 +171,2 @@
-        button.palette_label = label
+        button.palette_label = label
+        button.update_property([Gtk.AccessibleProperty.LABEL], [label])
